msgid "Importing"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/cli.md:17
msgid "The package is an executable (`pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`): you run it, you do not import it. Run it from a checkout with `moon run src/cli --target native -- <arguments>`, or build it with `moon build --target native` and call the produced binary."
msgstr "该包是一个可执行包（`pkgtype(kind: \"executable\")`）：你运行它，而不是导入它。在仓库的检出目录中用 `moon run src/cli --target native -- <arguments>` 运行它，或者用 `moon build --target native` 构建后调用生成的二进制文件。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:22
msgid "Its public functions are the building blocks of `main` and are covered by the package's tests. MoonBit 0.10 still lets another package import an executable package, but warns that this will become an error, so do not build on these functions from your own packages. The examples on this page are tests inside the package, where it is visible as `@cli`."
msgstr "它的公开函数是构成 `main` 的基本组件，并由该包的测试覆盖。MoonBit 0.10 仍允许其他包导入可执行包，但会警告这将来会成为错误，因此不要在你自己的包中基于这些函数进行构建。本页的示例是包内的测试，在那里该包以 `@cli` 的形式可见。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:28
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行"

#: manual/api/cli.md:34
msgid "Invocation"
msgstr "调用方式"

#: manual/api/cli.md:34
#: manual/api/report.md:43
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "效果"

#: manual/api/cli.md:36
msgid "parse the events and write a self-contained HTML report"
msgstr "解析事件并写出一份自包含的 HTML 报告"

#: manual/api/cli.md:37
msgid "read events from stdin, write HTML to stdout"
msgstr "从 stdin 读取事件，把 HTML 写到 stdout"

#: manual/api/cli.md:38
msgid "do not print the progress summary"
msgstr "不打印进度摘要"

#: manual/api/cli.md:39
msgid "open the written file with `open` (macOS)"
msgstr "用 `open` 打开写出的文件（macOS）"

#: manual/api/cli.md:40
msgid "print the command, arguments and timeout of the first `validation_failure`"
msgstr "打印第一个 `validation_failure` 的命令、参数和超时"

#: manual/api/cli.md:41
msgid "execute that command with its timeout and print its stdout"
msgstr "以该超时执行该命令并打印其 stdout"

#: manual/api/cli.md:42
msgid "print `mare-mark 0.3.0`"
msgstr "打印 `mare-mark 0.3.0`"

#: manual/api/cli.md:43
msgid "`mare-mark --help`, `-h`, or no arguments"
msgstr "`mare-mark --help`、`-h` 或不带参数"

#: manual/api/cli.md:43
msgid "print usage; with a command, print that command's help"
msgstr "打印用法；若指定了命令，则打印该命令的帮助"

#: manual/api/cli.md:45
msgid "Options may appear anywhere after the command. Unknown options and more than two positional arguments are errors. `replay` refuses `-` as input and refuses to execute without `--yes`."
msgstr "选项可以出现在命令之后的任何位置。未知选项以及多于两个的位置参数都是错误。`replay` 拒绝以 `-` 作为输入，并且没有 `--yes` 时拒绝执行。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:49
msgid "Exit codes: `0` on success, `1` when a file cannot be read or written, the JSONL is invalid, or a replay fails or times out, and `2` for usage errors (unknown command or option, missing arguments, including `replay --dry-run` without an artifact, and missing `--yes`). On targets other than native, `report` works through `render_jsonl_report`, and `replay` exits with `2`."
msgstr "退出码：成功时为 `0`；文件无法读取或写入、JSONL 无效、重放失败或超时时为 `1`；用法错误（未知命令或选项、缺少参数，包括没有产物的 `replay --dry-run`，以及缺少 `--yes`）时为 `2`。在 native 以外的目标上，`report` 通过 `render_jsonl_report` 工作，而 `replay` 以 `2` 退出。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:56
msgid "After writing a file, `report` prints the absolute output path, the number of non-empty input lines and the elapsed time in milliseconds."
msgstr "写入文件之后，`report` 会打印输出文件的绝对路径、非空输入行数以及以毫秒计的耗时。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:60
msgid "Requests"
msgstr "请求"

#: manual/api/cli.md:64
msgid "`Command` is the subcommand selected by the first argument."
msgstr "`Command` 是由第一个参数选出的子命令。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:78
msgid "`CliRequest` is the parsed command line."
msgstr "`CliRequest` 是解析后的命令行。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:94
msgid "`input` and `output` are the first two positional arguments. `error` holds the first usage error (`\"unknown option '…'\"`, `\"too many positional arguments\"`)."
msgstr "`input` 和 `output` 是前两个位置参数。`error` 保存第一个用法错误（`\"unknown option '…'\"`、`\"too many positional arguments\"`）。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:99
msgid "`parse_args` parses a full argument vector, including the program name."
msgstr "`parse_args` 解析完整的参数向量，包括程序名。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:105
msgid "Index 1 selects the command (`replay`, `report`, `--version`/`-V`, `--help`/`-h`; fewer than two arguments give `Help`). If `--help` or `-h` appears anywhere, the result only has `show_help = true` and the command. Otherwise arguments from index 2 on are flags (`--dry-run`, `--yes`, `--quiet`, `--open`), positionals, or errors; `-` counts as a positional."
msgstr "索引 1 选择命令（`replay`、`report`、`--version`/`-V`、`--help`/`-h`；少于两个参数时得到 `Help`）。只要任意位置出现 `--help` 或 `-h`，结果就只包含 `show_help = true` 和命令。否则，从索引 2 开始的参数是标志（`--dry-run`、`--yes`、`--quiet`、`--open`）、位置参数或错误；`-` 视为位置参数。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:124
msgid "`usage` returns the general help text; `command_help` returns the help of `Report` or `Replay`, and `usage()` for other commands."
msgstr "`usage` 返回总体帮助文本；`command_help` 返回 `Report` 或 `Replay` 的帮助，对其他命令返回 `usage()`。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:132
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "报告"

#: manual/api/cli.md:136
msgid "`render_jsonl_report` reads a JSONL file, renders it and writes the HTML."
msgstr "`render_jsonl_report` 读取 JSONL 文件，渲染它并写出 HTML。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:142
msgid "Arguments: input path, output path, and the target label (default `\"unknown\"`). Returns the output path, or an error message for an unreadable input, invalid events or an unwritable output."
msgstr "参数：输入路径、输出路径和目标标签（默认为 `\"unknown\"`）。返回输出路径；若输入不可读、事件无效或输出不可写，则返回错误消息。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:148
msgid "`report_html` is `@report.html`."
msgstr "`report_html` 就是 `@report.html`。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:154
msgid "Replay"
msgstr "重放"

#: manual/api/cli.md:158
msgid "`replay_spec_from_jsonl` extracts the replay command of the first `validation_failure` event in a JSONL text."
msgstr "`replay_spec_from_jsonl` 从 JSONL 文本中提取第一个 `validation_failure` 事件的重放命令。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:165
msgid "Lines before it are checked for valid JSON objects and a supported `artifact_version`, and otherwise skipped. The event must have a string `replay_command`; `replay_arguments` keeps its string elements, and `replay_timeout_ms` defaults to `5000`. Errors: invalid JSON, a non-object line, an unsupported version, a missing command, or no failure event at all."
msgstr "在它之前的行会被检查是否为有效的 JSON 对象且具有受支持的 `artifact_version`，除此之外被跳过。该事件必须有字符串类型的 `replay_command`；`replay_arguments` 保留其中的字符串元素，`replay_timeout_ms` 默认为 `5000`。错误情形：无效 JSON、非对象行、不受支持的版本、缺少命令，或者根本没有失败事件。"

#: manual/api/cli.md:186
msgid "`load_replay_spec` reads a file and calls `replay_spec_from_jsonl`."
msgstr "`load_replay_spec` 读取文件并调用 `replay_spec_from_jsonl`。"

#: manual/api/event.md:1
msgid "event API"
msgstr "event API"

#: manual/api/event.md:5
msgid "`Luna-Flow/mare_mark/event` receives what the runner emits. An `ObservationSink` is a record of five callbacks; the package provides an in-memory sink, a buffered JSONL sink, a streaming JSONL sink and a fan-out combinator. The JSONL format is the audit record that reports and replays read. See the [event design](../design/event.md)."
msgstr "`Luna-Flow/mare_mark/event` 接收运行器发出的内容。`ObservationSink` 是由五个回调组成的记录；该包提供内存接收器、带缓冲的 JSONL 接收器、流式 JSONL 接收器以及一个扇出组合子。JSONL 格式是报告和重放所读取的审计记录。参见 [event 设计](../design/event.md)。"

#: manual/api/event.md:11
msgid "Source: [`src/event/event.mbt`](../../../src/event/event.mbt)."
msgstr "源码：[`src/event/event.mbt`](../../../src/event/event.mbt)。"

