msgid "seeds, fingerprints, input lifecycle and setup timing"
msgstr "种子、指纹、输入生命周期与准备计时"

#: manual/architecture.md:14
msgid "Correctness"
msgstr "正确性"

#: manual/architecture.md:14
msgid "oracles, shrinking, crossover analysis"
msgstr "判定器、缩减、交叉点分析"

#: manual/architecture.md:15
msgid "Measurement"
msgstr "测量"

#: manual/architecture.md:15
msgid "the only loop that executes payloads and reads the clock"
msgstr "唯一执行负载并读取时钟的循环"

#: manual/architecture.md:16
msgid "Record"
msgstr "记录"

#: manual/architecture.md:16
msgid "sinks and the append-only JSONL record"
msgstr "接收器与只追加的 JSONL 记录"

#: manual/architecture.md:17
msgid "Analysis"
msgstr "分析"

#: manual/architecture.md:17
msgid "summaries, comparisons, tuning policy, the GEMM domain"
msgstr "摘要、比较、调优策略、GEMM 领域"

#: manual/architecture.md:18
msgid "Presentation"
msgstr "呈现"

#: manual/architecture.md:18
msgid "Plot IR and its JSON, SVG and HTML renderings"
msgstr "Plot IR 及其 JSON、SVG 和 HTML 渲染"

#: manual/architecture.md:19
msgid "Adapter"
msgstr "适配器"

#: manual/architecture.md:19
msgid "files, standard streams, process execution, exit codes"
msgstr "文件、标准流、进程执行、退出码"

#: manual/architecture.md:21
msgid "The import graph (test-only imports omitted) is acyclic:"
msgstr "导入图（省略仅用于测试的导入）是无环的："

#: manual/architecture.md:23
msgid "Package"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/architecture.md:23
msgid "Imports"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/architecture.md:25
msgid "nothing"
msgstr "无"

#: manual/architecture.md:26
msgid "`model` (and `generator` also `moonbitlang/x/crypto`)"
msgstr "`model`（`generator` 还导入 `moonbitlang/x/crypto`）"

#: manual/architecture.md:33
msgid "Nothing imports `cli`. `stats` and `report` do not depend on `runner`, so they can analyse and render records produced elsewhere."
msgstr "没有包导入 `cli`。`stats` 和 `report` 不依赖 `runner`，因此它们可以分析和渲染在别处产生的记录。"

#: manual/architecture.md:36
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "数据流"

#: manual/architecture.md:51
msgid "Everything before `run` is a description that is validated before it can run. Everything after `run` consumes preserved events. `run` is the only place where payloads execute and the clock is read; `cli` is the only place that touches files and processes."
msgstr "`run` 之前的一切都是描述，在能够运行之前就会被验证。`run` 之后的一切都消费保存下来的事件。`run` 是唯一执行负载并读取时钟的地方；`cli` 是唯一接触文件和进程的地方。"

#: manual/architecture.md:56
msgid "Boundaries between packages"
msgstr "包之间的边界"

#: manual/architecture.md:58
msgid "**Timing.** The timed region contains the payload and the output fold, plus setup only when the fixture's `SetupPolicy` includes it. Validation, warmup, calibration, event emission, the sink's `finish`, statistics and rendering are outside. The [runner design](design/runner.md) has the exact table."
msgstr "**计时。** 计时区域包含负载和输出折叠，仅当夹具的 `SetupPolicy` 包含准备工作时才包含准备工作。验证、预热、校准、事件发出、接收器的 `finish`、统计和渲染都在计时区域之外。确切的表格见 [runner 设计](design/runner.md)。"

#: manual/architecture.md:63
msgid "**Failure.** An operation's failure is a value (`ExecutionOutcome`), a validation's verdict is a value (`ValidationStatus`), and a failing validation emits a `ValidationFailure` with a minimized input and a replay command. A timeout or crash is infrastructure evidence, never a slow measurement."
msgstr "**失败。** 操作的失败是一个值（`ExecutionOutcome`），验证的判定结果是一个值（`ValidationStatus`），失败的验证会发出一个带有最小化输入和重放命令的 `ValidationFailure`。超时或崩溃是基础设施方面的证据，绝不是一次慢的测量。"

#: manual/architecture.md:68
msgid "**Statistics.** Raw observations are never filtered or aggregated in the record. `stats` computes decisions from paired arrays; `OutlierPolicy` is applied only to derived views."
msgstr "**统计。** 原始观测在记录中从不被过滤或聚合。`stats` 根据成对数组计算决策；`OutlierPolicy` 只应用于派生视图。"

#: manual/architecture.md:72
msgid "**Reports.** `report` is a pure projection. Invalid observations, discarded batches and series of implementations that failed validation are excluded from plots, and the failures are shown in the differential section."
msgstr "**报告。** `report` 是一个纯投影。无效观测、被丢弃的批次以及验证失败的实现的系列都会从图表中排除，失败则显示在差分部分。"

#: manual/architecture.md:76
msgid "**Tuning.** `tune` and `tune_gemm` hold policy and domain data. Building, validating and measuring candidates is done by the application with `runner`, so tuning measurements carry the same evidence as any other benchmark."
msgstr "**调优。** `tune` 和 `tune_gemm` 保存策略和领域数据。构建、验证和测量候选由应用借助 `runner` 完成，因此调优测量与其他任何基准测试携带相同的证据。"

#: manual/architecture.md:80
msgid "Reproducibility"
msgstr "可复现性"

#: manual/architecture.md:82
msgid "A result is determined by five recorded inputs: the plan (case id, implementations and their versions, fixture id and version), the validated protocol, the run seed, the environment snapshot, and the code revision in the snapshot's provenance. Inputs are derived from the seed by [`generator`](design/generator.md), the implementation order is derived from the seed, and the bootstrap is seeded, so everything except the timings themselves is bit-reproducible on every target. Timings are comparable across runs when `environment_compatible` holds."
msgstr "结果由五项记录下来的输入决定：计划（用例 id、实现及其版本、夹具 id 和版本）、经过验证的协议、运行种子、环境快照，以及快照来源信息中的代码修订版本。输入由 [`generator`](design/generator.md) 从种子派生，实现顺序由种子派生，自助法也带种子，因此除计时本身之外的一切在每个目标上都可逐位复现。当 `environment_compatible` 成立时，不同运行的计时可以相互比较。"

#: manual/architecture.md:91
msgid "Targets"
msgstr "目标"

#: manual/architecture.md:93
msgid "All packages build on every target. `runner.run` and `execute_operation` are `async` and need the `moonbitlang/async` runtime (native, JS, wasm). Subprocess workers, `mare-mark replay` and stdin/stdout reports are native only; the non-native `cli` entry point supports file-to-file reports. Native and JS timings are different populations; compare them only as separately labelled runs."
msgstr "所有包都能在每个目标上构建。`runner.run` 和 `execute_operation` 是 `async` 的，需要 `moonbitlang/async` 运行时（native、JS、wasm）。子进程工作者、`mare-mark replay` 以及 stdin/stdout 报告仅限 native；非 native 的 `cli` 入口点支持文件到文件的报告。native 与 JS 的计时属于不同的总体；只能把它们作为分别标注的运行来比较。"

#: manual/conventions.md:1
msgid "Repository conventions"
msgstr "仓库约定"

#: manual/conventions.md:3
msgid "These rules add to the Luna-Flow documentation standard for `mare_mark`."
msgstr "以下规则是 `mare_mark` 在 Luna-Flow 文档标准之外补充的约定。"

#: manual/conventions.md:5
msgid "Claims"
msgstr "能力描述"

#: manual/conventions.md:7
msgid "Pages describe what the current branch implements. A capability is documented as available only when code and focused tests exercise it. Fields and enum cases that are recorded but not acted upon (for example `ValidationCoverage`) are documented as such, and every design page ends with the package's boundaries."
msgstr "各页面描述当前分支实现的内容。只有当代码和针对性测试都覆盖某项能力时，它才会被记录为可用。被记录但不被执行的字段和枚举分支（例如 `ValidationCoverage`）也会如实说明，每个设计页面都以该包的边界结尾。"

#: manual/conventions.md:13
msgid "Package pages"
msgstr "包页面"

#: manual/conventions.md:15
msgid "Every package, including the `cli` executable and the small `ir_sink` facade, has an API page, a tutorial and a design page. There is no separate package reference; the package table in the [overview](index.md) links all three pages of each package. `report`, `runner` and `stats` also keep a short `README.mbt.md` beside their sources as a package-local pointer to the manual."
msgstr "每个包（包括 `cli` 可执行程序和小型的 `ir_sink` 外观）都有一个 API 页面、一个教程和一个设计页面。没有单独的包参考；[概览](index.md)中的包表格链接了每个包的全部三个页面。`report`、`runner` 和 `stats` 还在其源码旁保留一个简短的 `README.mbt.md`，作为指向本手册的包内指引。"

#: manual/conventions.md:21
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

#: manual/conventions.md:23
msgid "Runnable examples are complete `test` or `async test` blocks that show their output with `inspect` or `debug_inspect`, and they are checked as described in [verification](verification.md). Examples never show machine-dependent values such as timings or decisions on real measurements."
msgstr "可运行的示例是完整的 `test` 或 `async test` 块，它们用 `inspect` 或 `debug_inspect` 展示输出，并按 [验证](verification.md) 中的描述进行检查。示例从不展示依赖机器的值，例如计时或基于真实测量的决策。"

#: manual/conventions.md:28
msgid "Units and names"
msgstr "单位与名称"

#: manual/conventions.md:30
msgid "Times are microseconds unless a page says otherwise, written `µs`. Relative deltas are percentages. Schema identifiers (`mmkp_1`, `mmka_1`, `mmks_1`, `mmks_2`, `mmkts_1`) are written exactly as they appear in artifacts."
msgstr "时间默认以微秒计，写作 `µs`。相对差值以百分比表示。模式标识符（`mmkp_1`、`mmka_1`、`mmks_1`、`mmks_2`、`mmkts_1`）保持与产物中的写法一致。"

#: manual/conventions.md:34
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "翻译"

#: manual/conventions.md:36
msgid "Commands, identifiers, package paths, schema names and version numbers stay unchanged in every translation."
msgstr "命令、标识符、包路径、模式名称和版本号在所有译文中都保持不变。"

