#: manual/design/cli.md:12
msgid "Processes, standard streams and the filesystem are fully available only on the native target."
msgstr "进程、标准流和文件系统只有在 native 目标上才完全可用。"

#: manual/design/cli.md:14
msgid "Replay artifacts may come from untrusted sources and contain command lines."
msgstr "重放产物可能来自不可信的来源，并包含命令行。"

#: manual/design/cli.md:15
msgid "Scripts must be able to tell a broken input from a broken invocation."
msgstr "脚本必须能够区分损坏的输入和错误的调用。"

