#: manual/index.md:116
msgid "Using it in a project: keep the API pages of [`runner`](api/runner.md), [`stats`](api/stats.md) and [`model`](api/model.md) at hand; read the [fixture](tutorial/fixture.md) and [generator](tutorial/generator.md) tutorials for realistic inputs, and the [experiment tutorial](tutorial/experiment.md) for oracles and crossovers. For tuning, read [tune](tutorial/tune.md) and [tune_gemm](tutorial/tune_gemm.md)."
msgstr "在项目中使用它：把 [`runner`](api/runner.md)、[`stats`](api/stats.md) 和 [`model`](api/model.md) 的 API 页面放在手边；阅读 [fixture](tutorial/fixture.md) 和 [generator](tutorial/generator.md) 教程以构造真实的输入，阅读 [experiment 教程](tutorial/experiment.md)以了解判定器和交叉点。关于调优，请阅读 [tune](tutorial/tune.md) 和 [tune_gemm](tutorial/tune_gemm.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:122
msgid "Reviewing results or contributing: read the [architecture](architecture.md) and the design pages, starting with [runner](design/runner.md) (experimental design and calibration) and [stats](design/stats.md) (estimators, bootstrap and decision rule), then [verification](verification.md)."
msgstr "评审结果或参与贡献：阅读[架构](architecture.md)和各设计页面，从 [runner](design/runner.md)（实验设计与校准）和 [stats](design/stats.md)（估计量、自助法与决策规则）开始，然后阅读[验证](verification.md)。"

