msgid "`@experiment.ReferenceOracle::equal` or `ReferenceOracle::new`"
msgstr "`@experiment.ReferenceOracle::equal` 或 `ReferenceOracle::new`"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:11
msgid "compare floating-point results with a tolerance"
msgstr "用容差比较浮点结果"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:11
msgid "a comparator in `ReferenceOracle::equal`"
msgstr "`ReferenceOracle::equal` 中的比较函数"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:12
msgid "check implementations against each other"
msgstr "让各实现相互对照检查"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:13
msgid "make a failing input small"
msgstr "把失败的输入变小"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:13
msgid "`@experiment.Shrinker::new` and `@experiment.shrink`"
msgstr "`@experiment.Shrinker::new` 和 `@experiment.shrink`"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:14
msgid "find the scale where the winner changes"
msgstr "找到胜者发生变化的规模"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:14
msgid "`@experiment.comparator_label` and `@experiment.crossover_from_labels`"
msgstr "`@experiment.comparator_label` 和 `@experiment.crossover_from_labels`"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:44
msgid "Compare floating-point results with a tolerance"
msgstr "用容差比较浮点结果"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:46
msgid "A reassociated sum differs from the left-to-right sum in the last bits. Accept a relative error instead of demanding equality:"
msgstr "重新结合后的求和与从左到右的求和在最后几位上有所不同。请接受一个相对误差，而不是要求相等："

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:62
msgid "Check implementations against each other"
msgstr "让实现相互检查"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:64
msgid "Without a trusted reference, check that implementations agree:"
msgstr "在没有可信参考的情况下，检查各实现是否一致："

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:80
msgid "Pass the `OracleSpec` to `@runner.BenchSpec::advanced`; the runner checks every pair of implementations."
msgstr "把 `OracleSpec` 传给 `@runner.BenchSpec::advanced`；运行器会检查每一对实现。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:83
msgid "Make a failure small"
msgstr "把失败缩小"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:85
msgid "A list function fails for every list containing a negative number. Shrink the failing input by dropping elements:"
msgstr "某个列表函数对任何包含负数的列表都会失败。通过删除元素来缩减失败的输入："

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:104
msgid "The runner calls the same algorithm when a `BenchSpec` has a `shrinker`, and writes the minimal input into the failure event."
msgstr "当 `BenchSpec` 带有 `shrinker` 时，运行器会调用同一个算法，并把最小输入写入失败事件。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:107
msgid "Find where to switch implementations"
msgstr "找出切换实现的位置"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:109
msgid "Compare two implementations at several sizes, label each size, and look for one clean transition:"
msgstr "在多个规模上比较两个实现，为每个规模打上标签，并寻找一次干净的转变："

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:127
msgid "The first sequence has an `Unknown` between the `A` and `B` regions; the analysis does not guess where in that gap the boundary lies and reports no crossover. Measure the gap more finely, or decide the policy yourself."
msgstr "第一个序列在 `A` 区域和 `B` 区域之间有一个 `Unknown`；分析不会猜测分界位于这段间隙中的何处，而是报告没有交叉点。请更细致地测量这段间隙，或者自行决定策略。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:133
msgid "Turn a `Found` boundary into a `@model.DeploymentPolicy::Piecewise`; see the [model tutorial](model.md)."
msgstr "把 `Found` 分界转化为 `@model.DeploymentPolicy::Piecewise`；参见 [model 教程](model.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:135
msgid "Combine a reference and a relational oracle with `ReferenceAndRelational`."
msgstr "用 `ReferenceAndRelational` 组合参考判定器和关系判定器。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:136
msgid "The [experiment design](../design/experiment.md) proves that shrinking terminates and keeps the failure."
msgstr "[experiment 设计](../design/experiment.md)证明了缩减会终止并保持失败。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:141
msgid "**A comparator that disagrees with your scale order.** `crossover_from_labels` sorts by `ScaleDomain.compare`; the boundary is reported in that order."
msgstr "**与你的规模顺序不一致的比较函数。** `crossover_from_labels` 按 `ScaleDomain.compare` 排序；边界按该顺序报告。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:143
msgid "**Equality for floating-point results.** Use a tolerance that matches the algorithm's error bound."
msgstr "**对浮点结果使用相等比较。** 请使用与算法误差界相匹配的容差。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:145
msgid "**Shrinkers that grow the input.** Candidates should be smaller, or the budget is spent without progress."
msgstr "**会让输入变大的缩减器。** 候选应当更小，否则预算会在毫无进展的情况下耗尽。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:147
msgid "**Reading `NonMonotonic` as a crossover.** It is not; the preference flips."
msgstr "**把 `NonMonotonic` 当作交叉点。** 它不是；偏好发生了翻转。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:148
msgid "**A zero or unusable threshold in `comparator_label`.** With `0.0` only an exact tie is `\"Unknown\"`, so noise decides every other label; with `NaN`, an infinite or a negative threshold every label is `\"Unknown\"` and no crossover can be found. Use a finite, positive threshold."
msgstr "**`comparator_label` 中为零或不可用的阈值。** 用 `0.0` 时只有完全持平是 `\"Unknown\"`，其他每个标签都由噪声决定；用 `NaN`、无穷大或负阈值时，每个标签都是 `\"Unknown\"`，找不到任何交叉点。请使用有限的正阈值。"

#: manual/tutorial/experiment.md:155
msgid "[experiment API](../api/experiment.md), [experiment design](../design/experiment.md)."
msgstr "[experiment API](../api/experiment.md)、[experiment 设计](../design/experiment.md)。"

