msgstr "[runner 教程](runner.md)：运行中的判定器。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:1
msgid "fixture tutorial"
msgstr "fixture 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to hand benchmark inputs to implementations safely: an immutable input shared by everyone, a mutable input copied before each batch, an input prepared differently per implementation, and setup cost that is deliberately included in the measurement. Every example is a complete test."
msgstr "本教程展示如何把基准测试输入安全地交给各个实现：所有人共享的不可变输入、每个批次之前复制的可变输入、针对每个实现以不同方式准备的输入，以及有意计入测量的准备代价。每个示例都是一个完整的测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:10
msgid "share an input that nobody mutates"
msgstr "共享一个没有人修改的输入"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:11
msgid "copy a mutable input before each batch"
msgstr "在每个批次之前复制可变输入"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:11
msgid "`@fixture.Fixture::new` with a real `clone_input`"
msgstr "带有真正 `clone_input` 的 `@fixture.Fixture::new`"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:12
msgid "prepare a layout per implementation"
msgstr "为每个实现准备一种布局"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:12
msgid "the implementation id passed to `prepare`"
msgstr "传给 `prepare` 的实现 id"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:13
msgid "include setup cost in the measurement"
msgstr "把准备开销计入测量"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:13
msgid "`SetupTiming::IncludedInMeasurement` in the `SetupPolicy`"
msgstr "`SetupPolicy` 中的 `SetupTiming::IncludedInMeasurement`"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:14
msgid "run the lifecycle by hand"
msgstr "手动运行生命周期"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:14
msgid "`@fixture.materialize` and `@fixture.prepare`"
msgstr "`@fixture.materialize` 和 `@fixture.prepare`"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:41
msgid "Copy a mutable input"
msgstr "复制可变输入"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:43
msgid "An implementation that sorts in place must get a fresh copy each time:"
msgstr "原地排序的实现每次都必须拿到一个新的副本："

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:65
msgid "The runner calls `clone_input` for you; the explicit call here shows what happens."
msgstr "运行器会替你调用 `clone_input`；这里的显式调用展示了实际发生的过程。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:68
msgid "Prepare per implementation"
msgstr "按实现准备"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:70
msgid "`prepare` receives the implementation id. Give each implementation the layout it expects:"
msgstr "`prepare` 会收到实现 id。为每个实现提供它所期望的布局："

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:89
msgid "The transposition happens once per implementation and outside the clock."
msgstr "转置对每个实现只发生一次，并且在时钟之外。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:91
msgid "Include setup on purpose"
msgstr "有意计入准备工作"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:93
msgid "To measure \"allocate and compute\" as one cost, prepare per iteration and include it:"
msgstr "要把“分配并计算”作为一个整体代价来测量，请按迭代准备并将其计入："

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:116
msgid "Every observation then records `setup_timing` as `IncludedInMeasurement`, so a reader knows the number contains the allocation."
msgstr "这样每个观测都会把 `setup_timing` 记录为 `IncludedInMeasurement`，读者就知道这个数字包含了分配。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:121
msgid "Use the `sample_id` of `SampleContext` to tell validation (`-1`), warmup and calibration (other negative ids) from measured blocks; the [runner design](../design/runner.md) lists them."
msgstr "用 `SampleContext` 的 `sample_id` 区分验证（`-1`）、预热和校准（其他负 id）与被测量的区组；[runner 设计](../design/runner.md)列出了它们。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:124
msgid "Derive random inputs from `context.seed` with `@generator.derive_seed`; see the [generator tutorial](generator.md)."
msgstr "用 `@generator.derive_seed` 从 `context.seed` 派生随机输入；参见 [generator 教程](generator.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:129
msgid "**Identity `clone_input` with a mutating implementation.** Later batches see modified data."
msgstr "**对会修改输入的实现使用恒等 `clone_input`。** 之后的批次会看到被修改过的数据。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:131
msgid "**Expensive `materialize` work assumed to be timed.** It never is."
msgstr "**以为昂贵的 `materialize` 工作会被计时。** 它从不会被计时。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:132
msgid "**Including per-batch setup.** The amortized cost then depends on the calibrated batch size."
msgstr "**计入按批次的准备工作。** 这样摊销代价会取决于校准得到的批次大小。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:134
msgid "**Resetting by dropping a long-lived value.** The runner reuses it after reset."
msgstr "**通过丢弃长期存活的值来重置。** 运行器在重置后会复用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/fixture.md:139
msgid "[fixture API](../api/fixture.md), [fixture design](../design/fixture.md)."
msgstr "[fixture API](../api/fixture.md)、[fixture 设计](../design/fixture.md)。"

