msgstr "渲染文档"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_model.md:46
msgid "Plot comparison results"
msgstr "绘制比较结果"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_model.md:48
msgid "Turn `stats` comparisons into an interval plot, one point per dataset:"
msgstr "把 `stats` 的比较结果转化为区间图，每个数据集一个点："

#: manual/tutorial/ir_model.md:67
msgid "Attach correctness evidence"
msgstr "附加正确性证据"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_model.md:80
msgid "Render with `@report.plot_svg` to embed one chart in your own page, or export with `@report.plot_json` for other tools; see the [report API](../api/report.md)."
msgstr "用 `@report.plot_svg` 渲染，把一张图表嵌入你自己的页面，或者用 `@report.plot_json` 导出给其他工具；参见 [report API](../api/report.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_model.md:85
msgid "**Numeric x values.** They are strings and are spaced evenly in order of first appearance; sort the points if order matters."
msgstr "**数值型的 x 值。** 它们是字符串，并按首次出现的顺序均匀排布；如果顺序重要，请对点进行排序。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_model.md:87
msgid "**Empty series names.** They are drawn as `value`."
msgstr "**空的系列名称。** 它们被绘制为 `value`。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_model.md:91
msgid "[ir_model API](../api/ir_model.md), [ir_model design](../design/ir_model.md)."
msgstr "[ir_model API](../api/ir_model.md)、[ir_model 设计](../design/ir_model.md)。"

