msgstr "[report 教程](report.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:1
msgid "ir_sink tutorial"
msgstr "ir_sink 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:3
msgid "This short tutorial wires a benchmark's events into both memory and a JSONL record using the `ir_sink` shorthand."
msgstr "本简短教程使用 `ir_sink` 简写，把基准测试的事件同时接入内存和 JSONL 记录。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:8
msgid "keep events in memory"
msgstr "把事件保存在内存中"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:9
msgid "collect JSONL lines"
msgstr "收集 JSONL 行"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:10
msgid "write lines as they are produced"
msgstr "在行产生时就写出"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:11
msgid "do both"
msgstr "两者都做"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:39
msgid "Stream to a writer"
msgstr "流式写入写入器"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:50
msgid "Pass the sink to `@runner.RunContext::new`; the [runner tutorial](runner.md) shows a complete run."
msgstr "把接收器传给 `@runner.RunContext::new`；[runner 教程](runner.md)展示了一次完整的运行。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:55
msgid "Everything returned here is an `@event` type; see the [event tutorial](event.md) for custom sinks and the record format."
msgstr "这里返回的一切都是 `@event` 类型；关于自定义接收器和记录格式，参见 [event 教程](event.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:60
msgid "**Mixing `ir_sink` and `event` values.** Works, because they are the same types; there is nothing to convert."
msgstr "**混用 `ir_sink` 和 `event` 的值。** 可以，因为它们是相同的类型；无需任何转换。"

#: manual/tutorial/ir_sink.md:65
msgid "[ir_sink API](../api/ir_sink.md), [event API](../api/event.md)."
msgstr "[ir_sink API](../api/ir_sink.md)、[event API](../api/event.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:1
msgid "model tutorial"
msgstr "model 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:3
msgid "This tutorial shows how to describe a benchmark run with the shared types: an environment snapshot you can compare across runs, a protocol you can record, outcomes that say why an operation has no value, and a deployment policy derived from results. Every example is a complete test."
msgstr "本教程展示如何用共享类型描述一次基准测试运行：可在不同运行之间比较的环境快照、可以记录下来的协议、说明操作为何没有值的结果，以及从结果中得出的部署策略。每个示例都是一个完整的测试。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:10
msgid "describe the machine a run used"
msgstr "描述一次运行所用的机器"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:11
msgid "know whether two runs may be compared"
msgstr "判断两次运行能否比较"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:12
msgid "write down how a run was measured"
msgstr "写下一次运行是如何测量的"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:12
msgid "`@model.RunProtocol::new` and `@model.protocol_identity`"
msgstr "`@model.RunProtocol::new` 和 `@model.protocol_identity`"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:13
msgid "say why an operation has no value"
msgstr "说明一个操作为何没有值"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:13
msgid "the cases of `@model.ExecutionOutcome`"
msgstr "`@model.ExecutionOutcome` 的各个分支"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:14
msgid "turn a crossover into a deployment rule"
msgstr "把交叉点变成部署规则"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:14
msgid "`@model.CrossoverResult` and `@model.DeploymentPolicy`"
msgstr "`@model.CrossoverResult` 和 `@model.DeploymentPolicy`"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:28
msgid "Describe the machine and check whether two runs may be compared:"
msgstr "描述机器，并检查两次运行能否相互比较："

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:48
msgid "Different hosts, dates and revisions do not matter; the declared hardware, toolchain and flags do."
msgstr "不同的主机、日期和修订版本无关紧要；声明的硬件、工具链和标志才重要。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:53
msgid "Record the protocol with the results"
msgstr "把协议与结果一起记录"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:73
msgid "The identity is a short cache key. Store the whole protocol as well; the key covers only the warmup count, the confirmatory sample count and the threshold."
msgstr "身份是一个简短的缓存键。也请保存完整的协议；该键只涵盖预热次数、验证性样本数和阈值。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:76
msgid "Return precise outcomes"
msgstr "返回精确的结果"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:78
msgid "An implementation that cannot handle an input says so instead of returning a fake value:"
msgstr "无法处理某个输入的实现应如实说明，而不是返回一个伪造的值："

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:98
msgid "The runner counts `Unsupported` separately from failures, and the report lists it in the capability matrix."
msgstr "运行器把 `Unsupported` 与失败分开计数，报告会在能力矩阵中列出它。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:101
msgid "Turn a crossover into a deployment policy"
msgstr "把交叉点转化为部署策略"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:120
msgid "Build `Observation`, `Validation` and `RunSummary` values by hand to test your own sinks; the [event tutorial](event.md) does this."
msgstr "手工构建 `Observation`、`Validation` 和 `RunSummary` 值来测试你自己的接收器；[event 教程](event.md)就是这样做的。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:122
msgid "Use `ExpectedDifference` for documented deviations (for example a library that rounds differently by design), so they are counted, not hidden."
msgstr "对有文档记录的偏差（例如某个库按设计以不同方式舍入）使用 `ExpectedDifference`，使它们被计数而不是被隐藏。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:124
msgid "Check `ArtifactVersion::V1.identifier()` before reading foreign JSONL."
msgstr "在读取外来的 JSONL 之前检查 `ArtifactVersion::V1.identifier()`。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:128
msgid "**Describing the environment vaguely.** `\"cpu\"` matches every other `\"cpu\"`; write the model and the frequency policy."
msgstr "**含糊地描述环境。** `\"cpu\"` 与其他任何 `\"cpu\"` 都相匹配；请写明型号和频率策略。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:130
msgid "**Putting the run id only in `RunSummary`.** The runner's `run_id` is not unique; use `ProvenanceEnvironment.run_id`."
msgstr "**只把运行 id 放在 `RunSummary` 中。** 运行器的 `run_id` 不是唯一的；请使用 `ProvenanceEnvironment.run_id`。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:132
msgid "**Expecting the runner to act on every protocol field.** It does not act on `experiment_design`, `outlier_policy` or `validation_coverage`."
msgstr "**以为运行器会依据每个协议字段行事。** 它不会依据 `experiment_design`、`outlier_policy` 或 `validation_coverage` 行事。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:137
msgid "[model API](../api/model.md) and [model design](../design/model.md)."
msgstr "[model API](../api/model.md) 和 [model 设计](../design/model.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/model.md:138
msgid "[runner tutorial](runner.md) to use these types in a run."
msgstr "[runner 教程](runner.md)：在运行中使用这些类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:1
msgid "report tutorial"
msgstr "report 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:3
msgid "This tutorial publishes benchmark results: you render a JSONL event stream as a self-contained HTML page, see how failed validations appear, export the machine-readable `mmks_2` JSON, and draw plots of your own. The examples are complete tests; file writing is left to your program or to the [`mare-mark` command](cli.md)."
msgstr "本教程介绍如何发布基准测试结果：把 JSONL 事件流渲染为自包含 HTML 页面，查看失败验证的呈现方式，导出机器可读的 `mmks_2` JSON，并绘制自己的图表。示例都是完整测试；文件写入由你的程序或 [`mare-mark` 命令](cli.md)负责。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:11
msgid "render a JSONL stream as HTML"
msgstr "把 JSONL 流渲染为 HTML"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:11
msgid "`@report.document_from_jsonl` and `@report.html`"
msgstr "`@report.document_from_jsonl` 和 `@report.html`"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:12
msgid "report a run without a file"
msgstr "不经文件直接报告一次运行"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:12
msgid "an in-memory JSONL sink, then the two functions above"
msgstr "一个内存中的 JSONL 接收器，然后是上面的两个函数"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:13
msgid "export machine-readable results"
msgstr "导出机器可读的结果"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:14
msgid "draw one plot as SVG"
msgstr "把一个图表绘制为 SVG"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:15
msgid "publish numbers that did not come from a run"
msgstr "发布并非来自一次运行的数字"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:15
msgid "a `PlotDocument` built with `ir_model`"
msgstr "用 `ir_model` 构建的 `PlotDocument`"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:47
msgid "Save `page` as `report.html` and open it in a browser; it needs no server and no network."
msgstr "把 `page` 保存为 `report.html` 并在浏览器中打开；它不需要服务器，也不需要网络。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:52
msgid "Report a run straight from the runner"
msgstr "直接从运行器报告一次运行"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:54
msgid "`JsonlSink` produces exactly the stream that `document_from_jsonl` reads:"
msgstr "`JsonlSink` 生成的恰好就是 `document_from_jsonl` 读取的流："

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:85
msgid "Three scales times four blocks give twelve points, one per observation."
msgstr "三个规模乘以四个区组得到十二个点，每个观测一个。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:87
msgid "See what happens to a wrong implementation"
msgstr "看看错误的实现会怎样"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:89
msgid "A failing validation removes the implementation's points for that dataset and adds a mismatch row:"
msgstr "失败的验证会移除该实现在该数据集上的点，并添加一行不匹配记录："

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:107
msgid "Export JSON for other tools"
msgstr "为其他工具导出 JSON"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:109
msgid "`plot_json` writes the same document as `mmks_2` JSON, which a notebook or a dashboard can read without parsing HTML:"
msgstr "`plot_json` 将同一文档写为 `mmks_2` JSON，笔记本或仪表盘无需解析 HTML 即可读取："

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:122
msgid "Draw a plot of your own"
msgstr "绘制你自己的图表"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:124
msgid "Plot IR is plain data. Build a document by hand, for example from a tuning sweep, and render it with the same functions:"
msgstr "Plot IR 是纯数据。手工构建一个文档（例如来自一次调优扫描），并用相同的函数渲染它："

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:145
msgid "**Files and pipes.** `mare-mark report events.jsonl report.html` and `mare-mark report - -` do the reading and writing for you; see the [cli tutorial](cli.md)."
msgstr "**文件与管道。** `mare-mark report events.jsonl report.html` 和 `mare-mark report - -` 会替你完成读写；参见 [cli 教程](cli.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:148
msgid "**Statistics in the report.** Compute comparisons with `stats` and add them as `Interval` plots or as text around the HTML; the renderer does not compute them."
msgstr "**报告中的统计量。** 用 `stats` 计算比较结果，并把它们作为 `Interval` 图表或作为 HTML 周围的文本添加；渲染器不会计算它们。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:151
msgid "**Keep the JSONL.** The HTML is a projection that can be regenerated; the JSONL is the record."
msgstr "**保留 JSONL。** HTML 是可以重新生成的投影；JSONL 才是记录。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:156
msgid "**A stream with only calibration events.** It yields an error, because there is nothing to show."
msgstr "**只含校准事件的流。** 它会产生错误，因为没有可显示的内容。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:158
msgid "**Expecting the scale on the x axis.** The x value is the dataset index."
msgstr "**以为 x 轴上是规模。** x 值是数据集索引。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:159
msgid "**Mixing runs in one file.** Points of different runs are plotted together, and the last summary sets the run id."
msgstr "**在一个文件中混合多次运行。** 不同运行的点会被绘制在一起，并由最后一个摘要设定运行 id。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:161
msgid "**Changing `artifact_version`.** Only `mmka_1` is accepted."
msgstr "**修改 `artifact_version`。** 只接受 `mmka_1`。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:165
msgid "[report API](../api/report.md) and [report design](../design/report.md)."
msgstr "[report API](../api/report.md) 和 [report 设计](../design/report.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:166
msgid "[ir_model API](../api/ir_model.md) for the document types."
msgstr "[ir_model API](../api/ir_model.md)：文档类型。"

#: manual/tutorial/report.md:167
msgid "[event tutorial](event.md) for the stream format."
msgstr "[event 教程](event.md)：流的格式。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:1
msgid "runner tutorial"
msgstr "runner 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:3
msgid "This tutorial builds benchmark cases of increasing realism: a single comparison, a JSONL event stream, a mutable input with an explicit lifecycle, a stateful operation sequence, a wrong implementation caught and minimized before it is timed, and a protocol of your own. Every example is a complete `async test`; the outputs shown are the parts that do not depend on the speed of your machine."
msgstr "本教程构建逼真程度逐步提高的基准测试用例：单次比较、JSONL 事件流、具有显式生命周期的可变输入、有状态的操作序列、在计时之前被捕获并最小化的错误实现，以及你自己的协议。每个示例都是一个完整的 `async test`；展示的输出是不取决于你的机器速度的部分。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:12
msgid "compare implementations on the same input"
msgstr "在同一输入上比较多个实现"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:13
msgid "validate against a reference first"
msgstr "先对照参考实现进行验证"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:13
msgid "`.against_equal(...)` or a full oracle with `BenchSpec::advanced`"
msgstr "`.against_equal(...)`，或用 `BenchSpec::advanced` 构建完整的判定器"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:14
msgid "keep the raw record"
msgstr "保留原始记录"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:14
msgid "an `@event.JsonlSink` in the `RunContext`"
msgstr "`RunContext` 中的 `@event.JsonlSink`"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:15
msgid "give a mutable input a lifecycle"
msgstr "为可变输入提供生命周期"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:15
msgid "a `@fixture.Fixture` with `prepare` and `reset`"
msgstr "带有 `prepare` 和 `reset` 的 `@fixture.Fixture`"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:16
msgid "measure a stateful operation sequence"
msgstr "测量有状态的操作序列"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:16
msgid "`Implementation::in_process` with a `Context`"
msgstr "带有 `Context` 的 `Implementation::in_process`"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:17
msgid "choose how carefully to measure"
msgstr "选择测量的仔细程度"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:17
msgid "`@runner.ProtocolPreset` or `@runner.validate_protocol`"
msgstr "`@runner.ProtocolPreset` 或 `@runner.validate_protocol`"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:18
msgid "isolate a payload that may crash"
msgstr "隔离可能崩溃的负载"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:18
msgid "`Implementation::worker` (native)"
msgstr "`Implementation::worker`（native）"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:37
msgid "A run needs an environment snapshot. Describe the machine once:"
msgstr "一次运行需要一个环境快照。把机器描述一次："

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:49
msgid "Then compare two ways of summing `0, 1, …, n-1`:"
msgstr "然后比较两种对 `0, 1, …, n-1` 求和的方法："

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:80
msgid "Both implementations passed validation on both scales (four validations). Each scale then got one calibration per implementation and four blocks (`QuickCheck`: one exploratory, three confirmatory) of two batches each. `memory.observations[i].raw_elapsed_us` holds the per-iteration times."
msgstr "两个实现在两个规模上都通过了验证（四次验证）。随后每个规模为每个实现进行了一次校准，并运行了四个区组（`QuickCheck`：一个探索性、三个验证性），每个区组包含两个批次。`memory.observations[i].raw_elapsed_us` 保存了每次迭代的时间。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:87
msgid "Keep the run as JSONL"
msgstr "把运行保存为 JSONL"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:89
msgid "The JSONL stream is the audit record of a run. Send events to a `JsonlSink`, and to memory at the same time with `tee`:"
msgstr "JSONL 流是一次运行的审计记录。把事件发送到 `JsonlSink`，并用 `tee` 同时发送到内存："

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:118
msgid "One validation, one calibration, four observations and the summary make seven lines. Write `jsonl.to_jsonl()` to a file with your own IO, or stream lines as they happen with `@event.streaming_jsonl`."
msgstr "一次验证、一次校准、四个观测和摘要，共七行。用你自己的 IO 把 `jsonl.to_jsonl()` 写入文件，或者用 `@event.streaming_jsonl` 在事件发生时逐行流式写出。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:122
msgid "Give a mutable input an explicit lifecycle"
msgstr "为可变输入提供显式的生命周期"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:124
msgid "An in-place sort destroys its input. The fixture copies the generated array before every batch (`PerBatch`) and keeps that copy outside the timed region (`ExcludedFromMeasurement`):"
msgstr "原地排序会破坏它的输入。夹具在每个批次之前复制生成的数组（`PerBatch`），并把这次复制放在计时区域之外（`ExcludedFromMeasurement`）："

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:178
msgid "Without `clone_input` the second batch would sort an already sorted array and measure a different workload. To include the copy in the measurement, use `IncludedInMeasurement`; to copy before every single operation, use `PerIteration`. The [runner design](../design/runner.md) lists exactly what each combination puts inside the clock."
msgstr "如果没有 `clone_input`，第二个批次就会对一个已经排好序的数组排序，测量的是另一种工作负载。要把复制计入测量，请使用 `IncludedInMeasurement`；要在每一次操作之前都复制，请使用 `PerIteration`。[runner 设计](../design/runner.md)精确列出了每种组合会把哪些内容放进时钟之内。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:184
msgid "Validate a stateful sequence"
msgstr "验证有状态的序列"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:186
msgid "Operations that carry state, such as a running total, are validated as a sequence. The implementation and the reference oracle each thread their own context, and `sequence_length` sets how many steps are compared:"
msgstr "携带状态的操作（例如累计总和）作为序列进行验证。实现和参考判定器各自传递自己的上下文，`sequence_length` 设定比较多少步："

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:245
msgid "Step 4 of the sequence returns $3 \\cdot 5 = 15$, and the evidence records both the value and the context after the step."
msgstr "序列的第 4 步返回 $3 \\cdot 5 = 15$，证据同时记录了该值和该步之后的上下文。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:248
msgid "For a reference oracle, `sequence_length(input)` must return a positive value equal to the case length shown above. The runner uses that value for both sequences. A disagreement is a `RunConfigError`; an implementation or oracle that stops early produces an explicit invalid length-mismatch result. This prevents the shared prefix from being mistaken for a complete check."
msgstr "对于参考判定器，`sequence_length(input)` 必须返回一个正值，且等于上文所示的用例长度。运行器会将该值用于两个序列。若长度不一致，会抛出 `RunConfigError`；若实现或判定器提前停止，则会明确生成一条长度不匹配的无效结果。这样，共有前缀就不会被误认为是完整检查。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:254
msgid "Catch and minimize a wrong implementation"
msgstr "捕获并最小化错误的实现"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:256
msgid "An off-by-one implementation fails validation. With a shrinker, the runner reduces the failing input before writing the failure artifact:"
msgstr "一个差一错误的实现没有通过验证。有了缩减器，运行器会在写出失败产物之前缩小失败的输入："

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:294
msgid "The failure event carries the seed, the original and minimal fingerprints, the shrink path and the replay command `identity-worker off-by-one 40`. The implementation is still timed; the report hides its series and shows the mismatch instead."
msgstr "失败事件携带种子、原始指纹和最小指纹、缩减路径以及重放命令 `identity-worker off-by-one 40`。该实现仍会被计时；报告会隐藏它的系列，改为显示不匹配。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:299
msgid "Write your own protocol"
msgstr "编写你自己的协议"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:301
msgid "Presets cover common cases. For a gate in CI you may want more confirmatory blocks, a multiple of the number of implementations so that every rotation cycle is complete:"
msgstr "预设涵盖了常见情形。对于 CI 中的门禁，你可能需要更多的验证性区组，并取实现数量的倍数，使每个轮换周期都完整："

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:326
msgid "With two implementations, $2 + 30 = 32$ blocks form 16 complete cycles."
msgstr "对于两个实现，$2 + 30 = 32$ 个区组构成 16 个完整周期。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:330
msgid "**Isolate unsafe code.** `Implementation::worker` runs each operation in a child process with a timeout; a crash becomes an `Aborted` outcome and a hang a `Timeout`, both counted as infrastructure failures. Workers need the native target. See [`WorkerSpec`](../api/runner.md#workerspec)."
msgstr "**隔离不安全的代码。** `Implementation::worker` 在带超时的子进程中运行每次操作；崩溃会变成 `Aborted` 结果，挂起会变成 `Timeout`，两者都计为基础设施失败。工作者需要 native 目标。参见 [`WorkerSpec`](../api/runner.md#workerspec)。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:335
msgid "**Asynchronous devices.** Pass `synchronize=` to `Implementation::in_process` with a function that blocks until queued work is done. The runner calls it right before starting and right before stopping the clock."
msgstr "**异步设备。** 向 `Implementation::in_process` 传入 `synchronize=`，其函数会阻塞直到排队的工作完成。运行器会在启动时钟之前和停止时钟之前立即调用它。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:339
msgid "**Equal work per batch.** `BatchPolicy::SharedBatchSize` gives every implementation the smallest calibrated batch size."
msgstr "**每批次相等的工作量。** `BatchPolicy::SharedBatchSize` 为每个实现提供校准得到的最小批次大小。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:342
msgid "**Several implementations against each other.** Use `OracleSpec::Relational` or `ReferenceAndRelational` to compare implementations pairwise when no single reference exists; see the [experiment tutorial](experiment.md)."
msgstr "**多个实现相互比较。** 当不存在唯一参考时，使用 `OracleSpec::Relational` 或 `ReferenceAndRelational` 对实现进行两两比较；参见 [experiment 教程](experiment.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:347
msgid "**Reproducible inputs.** Derive dataset seeds inside the fixture with `@generator.derive_seed(context.seed, context.case_id, context.dataset_key.dataset_id)`; see the [generator tutorial](generator.md)."
msgstr "**可复现的输入。** 在夹具中用 `@generator.derive_seed(context.seed, context.case_id, context.dataset_key.dataset_id)` 派生数据集种子；参见 [generator 教程](generator.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:353
msgid "**Work inside the payload that is not the payload.** Allocation, parsing or printing inside the implementation function is timed. Move it into the fixture."
msgstr "**负载内部不属于负载的工作。** 实现函数内部的分配、解析或打印都会被计时。请把它们移到夹具中。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:356
msgid "**Forgetting `clone_input` for mutating code.** Later batches then measure a different input."
msgstr "**对会修改数据的代码忘记 `clone_input`。** 这样之后的批次测量的是另一个输入。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:358
msgid "**Reading timings from invalid observations.** Filter on `valid` and drop datasets with validation failures before comparing."
msgstr "**从无效观测中读取计时。** 比较之前请按 `valid` 过滤，并丢弃有验证失败的数据集。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:360
msgid "**Mixing phases.** Exploratory blocks are for orientation; decide on confirmatory ones."
msgstr "**混合不同阶段。** 探索性区组用于摸底；请基于验证性区组做决策。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:362
msgid "**Assuming `run_id` is unique.** It identifies protocol and case; put a unique id in `ProvenanceEnvironment.run_id`."
msgstr "**以为 `run_id` 是唯一的。** 它标识的是协议和用例；请把唯一 id 放入 `ProvenanceEnvironment.run_id`。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:364
msgid "**Calling `run` outside an async context.** It is an `async fn`."
msgstr "**在异步上下文之外调用 `run`。** 它是一个 `async fn`。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:365
msgid "**A zero threshold with noisy data.** `validate_protocol` accepts `0.0`, and `stats.compare_paired` then calls every non-zero difference `Faster` or `Slower`. Choose the smallest change you care about."
msgstr "**在有噪声的数据上使用零阈值。** `validate_protocol` 接受 `0.0`，此时 `stats.compare_paired` 会把每个非零差异都判为 `Faster` 或 `Slower`。请选择你关心的最小变化。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:371
msgid "[runner API](../api/runner.md) and [runner design](../design/runner.md)."
msgstr "[runner API](../api/runner.md) 和 [runner 设计](../design/runner.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:372
msgid "[stats tutorial](stats.md) to turn observations into a decision."
msgstr "[stats 教程](stats.md)：把观测转化为决策。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:373
msgid "[report tutorial](report.md) to publish the JSONL as HTML."
msgstr "[report 教程](report.md)：把 JSONL 发布为 HTML。"

#: manual/tutorial/runner.md:374
msgid "[fixture tutorial](fixture.md) and [experiment tutorial](experiment.md) for lifecycles and oracles."
msgstr "[fixture 教程](fixture.md)和 [experiment 教程](experiment.md)：生命周期与判定器。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:1
msgid "stats tutorial"
msgstr "stats 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:3
msgid "This tutorial turns timings into a decision you can defend: a robust summary, a paired comparison against a practical threshold, a reproducible bootstrap interval, and a cleaned view for plots that leaves the raw data alone. The examples are complete tests; paste one into a package that imports the modules shown below and run `moon test`."
msgstr "本教程把计时转化为站得住脚的决策：稳健的摘要、基于实际阈值的成对比较、可复现的自助法区间，以及不触动原始数据的、用于图表的清理后视图。示例都是完整的测试；把其中一个粘贴到导入了下面所示模块的包中，然后运行 `moon test`。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:11
msgid "describe one sample robustly"
msgstr "稳健地描述一个样本"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:12
msgid "decide whether a candidate is faster"
msgstr "判断候选是否更快"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:12
msgid "`@stats.compare_paired` with a positive threshold"
msgstr "带正阈值的 `@stats.compare_paired`"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:13
msgid "add a reproducible interval"
msgstr "加上可复现的区间"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:13
msgid "`@stats.compare_paired_with_bootstrap` or `@stats.bootstrap_interval`"
msgstr "`@stats.compare_paired_with_bootstrap` 或 `@stats.bootstrap_interval`"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:14
msgid "pair observations from a run"
msgstr "对一次运行的观测进行配对"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:14
msgid "filter by phase and implementation, sort by block"
msgstr "按阶段和实现过滤，按区组排序"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:15
msgid "clean a plot without touching the data"
msgstr "清理图表而不触碰数据"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:19
msgid "Add the module and import the two packages:"
msgstr "添加模块并导入这两个包："

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:35
msgid "Compare a candidate with a baseline measured in the same eight blocks:"
msgstr "把候选与在相同八个区组中测量的基线进行比较："

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:49
msgid "The median paired delta is 9.5 % of the baseline median, well past the 2 % threshold, so the decision is `Faster`."
msgstr "成对差值的中位数是基线中位数的 9.5 %，远超 2 % 的阈值，因此决策为 `Faster`。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:54
msgid "Summarize one implementation"
msgstr "总结一个实现"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:56
msgid "`summarize` gives classical and robust statistics side by side. When the mean and the median disagree, the sample has a tail worth looking at."
msgstr "`summarize` 并列给出经典统计量和稳健统计量。当均值和中位数不一致时，样本中存在值得查看的尾部。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:70
msgid "One run of 31.5 µs drags the mean to 14.5 µs; the median stays at 12.1 µs. Report the median and the IQR, and keep the maximum as a diagnostic."
msgstr "一次 31.5 µs 的运行把均值拉到 14.5 µs；中位数仍保持在 12.1 µs。请报告中位数和 IQR，并把最大值作为诊断量保留。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:73
msgid "Decide with a practical threshold"
msgstr "用实际阈值做决策"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:75
msgid "The threshold states the smallest change you care about. A 1 % improvement is `Faster` with a 0.5 % threshold and `Equivalent` with a 2 % threshold:"
msgstr "阈值表明你所关心的最小变化。1 % 的改进在 0.5 % 的阈值下为 `Faster`，在 2 % 的阈值下为 `Equivalent`："

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:93
msgid "Choose the threshold before looking at the data, and record it with the result."
msgstr "请在查看数据之前选定阈值，并把它与结果一起记录。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:95
msgid "Add a reproducible interval"
msgstr "添加可复现的区间"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:97
msgid "`compare_paired_with_bootstrap` keeps the decision and replaces the interquartile interval with a percentile bootstrap interval of the median delta. Fix the seed and the number of resamples so that regenerating the report gives the same numbers:"
msgstr "`compare_paired_with_bootstrap` 保留决策，并把四分位区间替换为中位数差值的百分位自助法区间。固定种子和重抽样次数，使重新生成报告时得到相同的数字："

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:120
msgid "The interval is in µs, the unit of the input: the median delta lies between −10 µs and −9 µs at 95 % bootstrap confidence."
msgstr "区间的单位是 µs，即输入的单位：在 95 % 的自助法置信度下，中位数差值位于 −10 µs 与 −9 µs 之间。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:123
msgid "Pair observations from a run"
msgstr "对一次运行中的观测进行配对"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:125
msgid "The runner emits one `Observation` per implementation and block. Pair them by `block_id`, keep only valid confirmatory observations, and compare. This example runs a real benchmark, so it shows only the numbers that do not depend on the machine:"
msgstr "运行器为每个实现和区组发出一个 `Observation`。按 `block_id` 配对，只保留有效的验证性观测，然后进行比较。本示例运行的是真实的基准测试，因此只展示不取决于机器的数字："

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:206
msgid "`QuickCheck` runs three confirmatory blocks, so there are three pairs. The decision itself depends on your machine."
msgstr "`QuickCheck` 运行三个验证性区组，因此有三对。决策本身取决于你的机器。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:209
msgid "Clean a plot without touching the data"
msgstr "清理图表而不触动数据"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:211
msgid "Apply an outlier policy to a copy that feeds a plot, and keep the original for the decision and the event stream:"
msgstr "把离群值策略应用于供图表使用的副本，而把原始数据保留给决策和事件流："

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:227
msgid "**Check the interval against the threshold yourself.** The decision uses only the point estimate. To require that the whole interval clears the threshold, convert the bounds to percent of the baseline median:"
msgstr "**自行检查区间是否越过阈值。** 决策只使用点估计。若要求整个区间都越过阈值，请把边界换算为基线中位数的百分比："

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:246
msgid "Even the least favourable end of the interval is a 9 % improvement, so the conclusion does not hinge on the point estimate."
msgstr "即使是区间最不利的一端也有 9 % 的改进，因此结论并不取决于点估计。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:249
msgid "**One decision per dataset.** Compare each dataset (scale) separately and feed the per-scale labels to `@experiment.crossover_from_labels` to find the scale where the winner changes; see the [experiment tutorial](experiment.md)."
msgstr "**每个数据集一个决策。** 分别比较每个数据集（规模），并把各规模的标签交给 `@experiment.crossover_from_labels`，以找出胜者发生变化的规模；参见 [experiment 教程](experiment.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:253
msgid "**Speedup from the relative delta.** `speedup` and `relative_delta_pct` are tied by $s = 1/(1 + r/100)$ whenever the baseline median is not zero; the [design page](../design/stats.md) derives it."
msgstr "**由相对差值得到加速比。** 只要基线中位数不为零，`speedup` 与 `relative_delta_pct` 就由 $s = 1/(1 + r/100)$ 联系在一起；[设计页面](../design/stats.md)给出了推导。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:259
msgid "**Sorting arrays independently.** Pairing is positional. Sorting baseline and candidate separately destroys the pairing; sort pairs, not arrays."
msgstr "**分别对数组排序。** 配对是按位置进行的。分别对基线和候选排序会破坏配对；请对配对排序，而不是对数组排序。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:261
msgid "**Mixing phases or targets.** Exploratory and confirmatory observations, native and JS timings are different populations. Filter before pairing."
msgstr "**混合不同阶段或目标。** 探索性与验证性观测、native 与 JS 计时都属于不同的总体。请在配对之前进行过滤。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:263
msgid "**A zero threshold.** With `practical_delta_pct = 0.0` only an exact tie is `Equivalent`; every other difference, however small, is `Faster` or `Slower`. A `NaN`, infinite or negative threshold gives `Invalid`. Use a finite, positive threshold such as `2.0`."
msgstr "**零阈值。** 当 `practical_delta_pct = 0.0` 时，只有完全持平是 `Equivalent`；其他任何差异，无论多小，都是 `Faster` 或 `Slower`。为 `NaN`、无穷大或负数的阈值会给出 `Invalid`。请使用有限的正阈值，例如 `2.0`。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:267
msgid "**Trusting the interval of a short run.** With a handful of blocks the bootstrap interval of the median covers the true median less often than its nominal level (87.5 % instead of 95 % for seven pairs); the [stats design](../design/stats.md) has the table."
msgstr "**相信短运行的区间。** 只有少数几个区组时，中位数的自助法区间覆盖真实中位数的频率低于其名义水平（七个配对时为 87.5 % 而不是 95 %）；[stats 设计](../design/stats.md)中有对应的表格。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:271
msgid "**`NaN` timings.** A single `NaN` makes every statistic of `summarize` `NaN` and the decision of `compare_paired` `Invalid`; the bootstrap functions return `NonFiniteSample`. Find and drop the broken observation instead of filtering `NaN` silently."
msgstr "**`NaN` 计时值。** 单个 `NaN` 就会使 `summarize` 的每个统计量都成为 `NaN`，并使 `compare_paired` 的决策成为 `Invalid`；自助法函数会返回 `NonFiniteSample`。请找出并丢弃损坏的观测，而不是悄悄地过滤掉 `NaN`。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:275
msgid "**Reading `summarize([])`.** An empty sample returns zeros; check `count`."
msgstr "**读取 `summarize([])` 的结果。** 空样本返回全零；请检查 `count`。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:276
msgid "**Comparing interval and threshold directly.** The interval is in the input unit, the threshold in percent."
msgstr "**直接比较区间和阈值。** 区间以输入单位表示，阈值以百分比表示。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:278
msgid "**Deleting outliers from the source.** Filter a copy; the JSONL stream is the audit record."
msgstr "**从源数据中删除离群值。** 请过滤副本；JSONL 流是审计记录。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:283
msgid "[stats API](../api/stats.md) for every function and error."
msgstr "[stats API](../api/stats.md)：每个函数和错误。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:284
msgid "[stats design](../design/stats.md) for the estimators, the bootstrap and the threshold rule."
msgstr "[stats 设计](../design/stats.md)：估计量、自助法和阈值规则。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:286
msgid "[runner tutorial](runner.md) to produce the observations compared here."
msgstr "[runner 教程](runner.md)：生成这里所比较的观测。"

#: manual/tutorial/stats.md:287
msgid "[report tutorial](report.md) to publish the result."
msgstr "[report 教程](report.md)：发布结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:1
msgid "tune tutorial"
msgstr "tune 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:3
msgid "This tutorial runs a small tuning loop: define a candidate space, score candidates from timing samples, choose a winner with a practical threshold, look at the trade-offs on a Pareto front, and restrict a large space to a reproducible random subset. Timings are given as numbers so the examples are deterministic; in practice they come from `runner` observations."
msgstr "本教程运行一个小型调优循环：定义候选空间，根据计时样本为候选打分，用实际阈值选出胜者，在 Pareto 前沿上查看权衡，并把大空间限制为一个可复现的随机子集。计时以数字给出，因此示例是确定性的；实践中它们来自 `runner` 的观测。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:11
msgid "describe the candidates"
msgstr "描述候选"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:12
msgid "score a candidate from timings"
msgstr "根据计时数据为候选打分"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:13
msgid "pick a winner with practical ties"
msgstr "在考虑实际持平的情况下选出胜者"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:14
msgid "see the speed and size trade-offs"
msgstr "查看速度与大小之间的权衡"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:15
msgid "score every candidate that meets the constraints"
msgstr "为每个满足约束的候选打分"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:16
msgid "measure a reproducible subset"
msgstr "测量一个可复现的子集"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:16
msgid "`@tune.seeded_order`, then a prefix"
msgstr "`@tune.seeded_order`，然后取一个前缀"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:44
msgid "Prefer the cheaper of two tied candidates"
msgstr "在两个持平的候选中优先选择更省的那个"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:46
msgid "`block-64` is within 3 % of `block-32` but needs a quarter of the workspace. With a 5 % threshold and workspace as secondary metric, it wins:"
msgstr "`block-64` 与 `block-32` 相差在 3 % 以内，但只需要四分之一的工作区。在 5 % 的阈值下、以工作区作为次要指标时，它胜出："

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:59
msgid "Show the trade-offs"
msgstr "展示权衡"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:73
msgid "`medium` is slower and larger than `small`, so it is not on the front."
msgstr "`medium` 比 `small` 更慢也更大，因此它不在前沿上。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:75
msgid "Search a space with constraints"
msgstr "在带约束的空间中搜索"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:97
msgid "The 128×128 tile needs 128 KiB and is rejected before it is measured."
msgstr "128×128 的分片需要 128 KiB，在测量之前就被拒绝了。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:99
msgid "Sample a large space reproducibly"
msgstr "可复现地对大空间抽样"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:114
msgid "The same seed gives the same candidates whatever order the space is listed in, and the candidates are spread over the whole space even though the ids differ only in their last characters. Record the seed with the result."
msgstr "无论空间以何种顺序列出，相同的种子都会给出相同的候选；即使 id 只在最后几个字符上不同，这些候选也分散在整个空间中。请把种子与结果一起记录。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:120
msgid "**Confirm finalists.** Re-measure the best few with `@tune.confirmation_count(base, relative_iqr, budget)` fresh samples and select again on those; the [tune design](../design/tune.md) explains why the first selection is optimistic."
msgstr "**确认决赛候选。** 用 `@tune.confirmation_count(base, relative_iqr, budget)` 个新样本重新测量最好的几个候选，并在这些样本上再次选择；[tune 设计](../design/tune.md)解释了为什么第一次选择是偏乐观的。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:124
msgid "**Hold out shapes.** Choose with some shapes, then check the winner on a `ShapeHoldout`."
msgstr "**留出部分形状。** 用一部分形状做选择，然后在 `ShapeHoldout` 上检查胜者。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:126
msgid "**Measure with the runner.** Wrap each candidate in a `@runner.Implementation`, run them in one case so they share blocks, and feed per-candidate confirmatory medians to `score_samples`."
msgstr "**用运行器测量。** 把每个候选包装成 `@runner.Implementation`，在同一个用例中运行它们使其共享区组，并把每个候选的验证性中位数交给 `score_samples`。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:129
msgid "**A worked example.** [`tune_gemm`](tune_gemm.md) applies all of this to blocked matrix multiplication."
msgstr "**完整示例。** [`tune_gemm`](tune_gemm.md) 把这一切应用于分块矩阵乘法。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:134
msgid "**Selecting on exploration data only.** The winner's curse makes it look better than it is."
msgstr "**只基于探索数据做选择。** 赢家诅咒会让它看起来比实际更好。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:136
msgid "**A threshold of zero with noisy data.** Ties are then decided by noise."
msgstr "**在嘈杂数据上使用零阈值。** 这样持平就由噪声来决定。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:137
msgid "**Ids that are not unique.** Selection and ordering assume unique ids."
msgstr "**不唯一的 id。** 选择和排序都假设 id 唯一。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:138
msgid "**Comparing subsets across versions.** The order for a seed changed when `seeded_order` gained its finalizer; regenerate recorded subsets."
msgstr "**跨版本比较子集。** `seeded_order` 加入终结器后，某个种子对应的顺序发生了变化；请重新生成记录下来的子集。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:140
msgid "**Trusting the `exhaustive_scores` policy string.** `global:<id>` is the raw minimum, without practical ties or confirmation; decide with `select_best`."
msgstr "**相信 `exhaustive_scores` 的策略字符串。** `global:<id>` 是原始最小值，没有考虑实际持平，也没有确认；请用 `select_best` 做决策。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:145
msgid "[tune API](../api/tune.md), [tune design](../design/tune.md)."
msgstr "[tune API](../api/tune.md)、[tune 设计](../design/tune.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune.md:146
msgid "[tune_gemm tutorial](tune_gemm.md)."
msgstr "[tune_gemm 教程](tune_gemm.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:1
msgid "tune_gemm tutorial"
msgstr "tune_gemm 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:3
msgid "This tutorial tunes the blocking parameters of a matrix multiplication end to end: generate reproducible inputs, filter candidates by constraints, validate each one against the reference, measure the survivors with `runner`, score and select them with `tune`, and serialize the result."
msgstr "本教程端到端地调优矩阵乘法的分块参数：生成可复现的输入，按约束过滤候选，用参考实现验证每个候选，用 `runner` 测量留下来的候选，用 `tune` 为它们打分并做出选择，最后序列化结果。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:10
msgid "generate reproducible matrices"
msgstr "生成可复现的矩阵"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:11
msgid "list the candidates that fit a shape and a workspace limit"
msgstr "列出适合某个形状和工作区上限的候选"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:12
msgid "check a candidate, tails included"
msgstr "检查一个候选，包括尾部"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:13
msgid "measure candidates"
msgstr "测量候选"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:13
msgid "`execute_candidate` inside a `runner` case"
msgstr "在 `runner` 用例中使用 `execute_candidate`"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:14
msgid "choose and record the winner"
msgstr "选出并记录胜者"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:14
msgid "`@tune.select_best` and `@tune_gemm.config_json`"
msgstr "`@tune.select_best` 和 `@tune_gemm.config_json`"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:52
msgid "Filter the candidate grid"
msgstr "过滤候选网格"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:63
msgid "Validate every candidate, including tails"
msgstr "验证每个候选，包括尾部"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:81
msgid "Tolerance `0.0` is correct for the built-in kernel because it sums in the same order as the reference; the [design page](../design/tune_gemm.md) derives the tolerance for kernels that reorder."
msgstr "容差 `0.0` 对内置内核是正确的，因为它与参考实现以相同的顺序求和；[设计页面](../design/tune_gemm.md)推导了重排序内核的容差。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:85
msgid "Measure and select"
msgstr "测量与选择"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:87
msgid "Wrap each candidate in a runner implementation, measure them in one case so they share blocks, and select on the confirmatory medians:"
msgstr "把每个候选包装成一个运行器实现，在同一个用例中测量它们使其共享区组，并基于验证性中位数进行选择："

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:137
msgid "Which candidate wins depends on your machine; the procedure does not."
msgstr "哪个候选胜出取决于你的机器；流程本身则不取决于机器。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:139
msgid "Record the configuration"
msgstr "记录配置"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:154
msgid "Store the JSON, the JSONL of the measurements and a `GemmEnvironment` together; reuse the tuned choice only where `environment_compatible` holds."
msgstr "把 JSON、测量的 JSONL 和一个 `GemmEnvironment` 保存在一起；只在 `environment_compatible` 成立的地方复用调优得到的选择。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:159
msgid "Convert µs per operation to GFLOP/s with $2mnk/(t \\cdot 10^3)$."
msgstr "用 $2mnk/(t \\cdot 10^3)$ 把每次操作的 µs 换算为 GFLOP/s。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:160
msgid "Hold out shapes: select on some, confirm on `boundary_shapes` and on larger shapes; see the [tune tutorial](tune.md)."
msgstr "留出部分形状：在一部分形状上选择，然后在 `boundary_shapes` 和更大的形状上确认；参见 [tune 教程](tune.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:162
msgid "Use `seeded_order` to measure a random subset of the 486 candidates when the full grid is too slow."
msgstr "当完整网格太慢时，用 `seeded_order` 测量 486 个候选中的一个随机子集。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:167
msgid "**Comparing different timing scopes.** The scope is part of the id for a reason."
msgstr "**比较不同的计时范围。** 计时范围成为 id 的一部分是有原因的。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:169
msgid "**Forgetting tails.** A kernel that is right for 64 × 64 can be wrong for 63 × 64."
msgstr "**忘记尾部。** 对 64 × 64 正确的内核，对 63 × 64 可能是错误的。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:171
msgid "**Equality checks for reordering kernels.** Use the $2\\gamma_k k$ bound."
msgstr "**对重排序内核使用相等性检查。** 请使用 $2\\gamma_k k$ 界。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:172
msgid "**Batched operands from one call of `reproducible_matrix`.** It makes one matrix; concatenate per batch."
msgstr "**用一次 `reproducible_matrix` 调用生成批量操作数。** 它只生成一个矩阵；请按批次拼接。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:177
msgid "[tune_gemm API](../api/tune_gemm.md), [tune_gemm design](../design/tune_gemm.md)."
msgstr "[tune_gemm API](../api/tune_gemm.md)、[tune_gemm 设计](../design/tune_gemm.md)。"

#: manual/tutorial/tune_gemm.md:178
