#~ msgstr "Scaling、interval、change-point 连接各系列的类别均值；raw distribution、block order、outlier、Pareto 使用点；heatmap 使用色块。精确签名见 `src/report/pkg.generated.mbti`。"

#~ msgid "`runner` owns executable benchmark cases and monotonic timed batches."
#~ msgstr "`runner` 管理可执行 benchmark case 和单调时钟 batch。"

#~ msgid "`Implementation::in_process` registers a stateful callback; `Implementation::worker` registers a native isolated subprocess. Both accept an optional blocking `synchronize` hook for asynchronous backends."
#~ msgstr "`Implementation::in_process` 注册带状态回传的进程内实现；`Implementation::worker` 注册 native 隔离子进程；两者都可接收异步后端使用的阻塞式 `synchronize` 钩子。"

#~ msgid "`WorkerSpec::new` defines argument encoding, output decoding, timeout, and working directory."
#~ msgstr "`WorkerSpec::new` 定义参数编码、输出解码、timeout 与工作目录。"

#~ msgid "`OutputSink::new` folds outputs during the timed batch, then retains the finished value with `Bench::keep` after the clock stops."
#~ msgstr "`OutputSink::new` 折叠输出，并通过 `Bench::keep` 保留最终值。"

#~ msgid "`single_step` builds an immutable common-case description; its combinators return new values and `compile` aggregates configuration errors."
#~ msgstr "`single_step` 创建不可变的常见 case 描述；组合器返回新值，`compile` 聚合配置错误。"

#~ msgid "`ValidatedBenchPlan` and `ValidatedProtocol` are the only inputs accepted by the runtime boundary."
#~ msgstr "`ValidatedBenchPlan` 与 `ValidatedProtocol` 是运行边界接受的唯一配置类型。"

#~ msgid "`ProtocolPreset` provides `QuickCheck`, `Development`, `RegressionGate`, and validated custom protocols."
#~ msgstr "`ProtocolPreset` 提供 `QuickCheck`、`Development`、`RegressionGate` 与已验证的自定义协议。"

#~ msgid "`RunContext` groups protocol, environment, observation sink, and seed."
#~ msgstr "`RunContext` 组合 protocol、environment、observation sink 与 seed。"

#~ msgid "`balanced_order` rotates implementation order by block id."
#~ msgstr "`balanced_order` 按 block id 轮转实现顺序。"

#~ msgid "`run(plan, context)` fingerprints input, validates every sequence step outside timing, shrinks failures, emits replay artifacts, then measures balanced batches and returns `RunSummary`."
#~ msgstr "`run(plan, context)` 先 fingerprint 并在计时外逐步验证/缩减失败，再执行 balanced measurement、写事件并返回 `RunSummary`。"

#~ msgid "`run` calibrates each implementation toward the configured target batch time, caps work at the iteration and sample-time bounds, and applies a common batch size only when `SharedBatchSize` is selected. Exploratory and confirmatory observations remain separate phases."
#~ msgstr "`run` 会为每个实现向目标 batch 时间校准，并受 iteration 与 sample-time 上限约束；只有选择 `SharedBatchSize` 时才应用共同 batch size。exploratory 与 confirmatory observation 使用不同 phase。"

#~ msgid "The JSONL summary records the complete `EnvironmentSnapshot`, including device, thread/concurrency count, and frequency policy. Use `stats.summarize` over repeated valid observations for median-based reporting."
#~ msgstr "JSONL summary 会记录完整 `EnvironmentSnapshot`，包括 device、线程/concurrency 数与 frequency policy。对重复的有效 observation 使用 `stats.summarize` 可得到 median 汇总。"

